	(text "Host: Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32S3 (castellated SMD footprint). It provides USB-C, the 3.3 V regulator, RESET and BOOT buttons.\nD0/D1 CAN_TX/CAN_RX (TWAI, CAN 2.0B)   D2 TP_SCL (GPIO3)   D3 TP_SDA (GPIO4)   D4 TP_INT (GPIO5)   D5 TP_RST (GPIO6)\nI2C is remapped off the XIAO default D4/D5 to match the PCB bus order: Wire.begin(4, 3), <= 400 kHz.\nD6-D9 status LEDs (active high, ~1.5 mA): HB heartbeat, SENSE scanning, COMM USB/CAN traffic, FAULT error. D10 spare.\nCAN is kept off D6/D7 (UART0): the ROM prints boot logs there, which would put garbage on the bus at every reset.\nXIAO 3V3 pin supplies the whole board (FT5316, transceiver, LEDs: < 50 mA). 5V pin = XIAO USB VBUS; CAN-bus 5 V enters it through U3 (Power sheet).\nBottom pads (JTAG, USB, BAT) left unconnected. Keep Wi-Fi/BLE off while scanning." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3a043af3-2989-4e0a-a2cb-f0183618880c"))
